{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Ephemeral Frame is a surreal first-person exploration game about going inside pictures</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These may take the form of photos, movies, or other imagery, with each transporting you to a completely different place and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/FrameShowoff.gif?t=1745691505\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Traverse the Dreamscape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each world presents a distinct atmosphere alongside its own puzzles to solve and things to find. Hit the arcade, surf the web, golf, or even go fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/environmentsWIP.png?t=1745691505\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Capture Moments in Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress you will find equipment that can take you further into the dream. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The camera is one such item, allowing you to create your own frames where and whenever you please and return to them at a moments notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/CameraShowoff.gif?t=1745691505\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Piece Together Photo Fragments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By reassembling a torn up image you can restore a once-destroyed frame and gain access to the world within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/Fragments.gif?t=1745691505\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605360?t=1745691505","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605360?t=1745691505","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.s